<</DocID(AN5054)/Document_Title(How to perform secure programming using STM32CubeProgrammer)/Creator(C2 v20.4.0000 build 240 - c2_rendition_config : Techlit_Active)/ModDate(D:20241126161248+01'00')/Document_Type(Application note)/CreationDate(D:20241120143928Z)/Subject(This document specifies the steps and tools required to prepare SFI \(secure internal firmware install\), SFIx \(secure external firmware install\), or SSP \(secure secret provisioning\) images. It then describes how to program these into STM32 MCU devices that support SFI/SFIx on-chip internal memory, external flash memory or, for the SSP install procedure, STM32 MPU devices. It is based on the STM32CubeProgrammer tool set \(STM32CubeProg\).)/Author(STMICROELECTRONICS)/Classification(Public)/Alternate_Name(AN5054)/Title(How to perform secure programming using STM32CubeProgrammer - Application note)/Revision(17)/Producer(Acrobat Elements 15.0 \(Windows\); modified using iText 2.1.7 by 1T3XT)>>
endobj
